  "conformsTo": "http://mlcommons.org/croissant/1.1",
  "name": "RAW-RAIN-bayer",
  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tDataset Card for R\u00b3 Bayer Dataset\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tDataset Summary\n\t\n\nThe R\u00b3 (Reconstruction, Raw, and Rain) Bayer Dataset is a large-scale, real-world stereo dataset designed for deraining tasks directly in the raw Bayer domain. It was collected using a dual-camera synchronized setup capturing raw Bayer images. Unlike popular synthetic datasets, R\u00b3 uses a real-world rain simulation system to generate realistic rain artifacts, including scene depth effects and droplets on windshields. The\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/realrainmaker/RAW-RAIN-bayer.",
